  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "The first step of creating an enemy is to add a new <b>Prefab</b>. Let\u2019s add a Hoverbot!\n\n<b>Prefabs</b> are templates for GameObjects with preset components. \n\nThey're stored as assets that you can simply drag into the Scene view."
